 note for her  and he leaves the scene  joe starts seeing beck's therapist dr  nikki but going by the name of paul  after joe accuses beck of cheating on  him with dr nikki beck breaks up with  joe joe then begins happily dating a  woman named karen minty and beck gets a  book deal after writing about peach's  death  joe and beck begins seeing each other  again in secret after a few months and  joe then breaks up with karen who warns  beck about joe's suspicious past  later joe recalls his ex-girlfriend  candace cheating on him and then joe  killing the man who she cheated on him  with  he also recalls their final fight  leading to him taking her out to the  woods and smacking her head on a piece  of wood after she tried to escape  leaving her for dead  beck looks into their relationship as  her suspicions grow and it's revealed  that beck actually was cheating on joe  with dr nikki  after fighting they make up but beck  then discovers a box with her old phone  benjies and peaches phones and other  gross mementos joe then locks her in the  glass cage for protection  while in the cage beck tries to fake  understanding of joe's actions writing a  story which blames dr nikki for  everything joe had done  after stabbing joe in the cage with a  typewriter piece and trying to escape  joe kills beck off-screen  several months later we learned that joe  used beck's writing to frame dr nikki  who went to prison putting joe in the  clear  the season ends with candace who is  presumed to be dead at this point  entering the bookstore and telling joe  that they have some unfinished business  season two begins with joe recalling the  conversation with candace who threatened  to make him suffer after what he did to  her joe then flees to los angeles where  he takes the fake name of will  bettelheim and gets a job at a book cafe  called an avrin there he meets love  quinn daughter of the owners of an avern  and twin sister to forty quinn the  store's eccentric manager  love who joe directs his inner dialogue  toward this season takes joe out for the  evening and you can see her start to  fall for him  it's then revealed that joe was stalking  love before getting his apartment and  before applying for work at an average  it's also revealed that joe stole the  name will bettleheim from a man who he  has locked in the glass cage this time  in a storage unit  joe finds out that the real will  bettleheim owes 50 000 to a man named  jasper who cuts off joe's finger because  he thought that joe was will  after a final confrontation in the  storage unit joe kills jasper and gets  his finger reattached  joe continues stalking love and we meet  joe's neighbors ellie a 15 year old  aspiring filmmaker and delilah a  reporter who tells joe that she thinks  she was raped by a popular comedian  named henderson  joba friends loves twin 40 an aspiring  film writer producer and director  joe finds out that ellie is spending  time with henderson so he sneaks his way  into a party at henderson's house and 40  joins  at the party 40 has a drug field  breakdown which is caught on camera joe  takes 40 home where love takes care of  him and joe and love get together and  start dating  joe learns about a secret room in  henderson's house so he breaks in and  discovers pictures of underage girls and  leader knox henderson who was attempting  to drug ellie at the time down a flight  of stairs killing him  while out of town 40 meets a woman going  by the name of amy who is actually  candace following joe after seeing the  video of 40 at henderson's party  falling in love with love joe joins her  at a wellness retreat for her parents  anniversary fordy and candice still  using the name of amy come to the  retreat as well  and candace convinces forty to adapt  beck's book into a screenplay  love suspicious of candace hires a  private investigator to follow her  candice breaks into joe's apartment but  love is waiting for her love learned  candace's identity and she confronts joe  who convinces her that he fled new york  to get away from the obsessive candice  and that her darker accusations are  simply lies  love breaks up with joe anyway and he  tries to find a way to win her back  delilah the apartment manager and joe's  neighbor looks in joe's apartment for  more information on henderson and she  finds the keys to his storage unit  joe finds her there and locks her in the  cage  after 40 drugs joe during their final  hours and rewriting his screenplay joe  reconciles with love but loses some time  forty finally finishes the script  correctly deducing that beck's  ex-boyfriend killed her instead of dr  nikki because he believes that he did  the same to their family's au pair after  an abusive relationship  after waking up the next morning joe  races to the storage unit and finds  delilah dead in the cage  candace finds jo in the cage and locks  him inside she calls love telling her to  come to the storage unit to prove that  joe is dangerous but love kills candace  and professes her love for joe  she admits to killing forty's au pair  and delilah both to protect the ones  that she cares about  she also tells joe that she is pregnant  with his child who she believes to be a  girl  joe decides to stay with love and start  a family together but forty learns joe's  true pass from dr nikki who's in prison  and tries to keep joe away from love 40  points a gun at joe but joe is saved by  officer fincher a police detective who  had a relationship with delilah who  shoots and kills 40.  40 is blamed for henderson and candace's  deaths but the quinn family sweeps it  under the rug with lawyers and money  joe then starts to give money to ellie  who moves east to avoid child protective  services and joe and love move into a  new house the season ends with joe  returning to his obsessive behavior  turning his inner dialogue toward their  new female neighbor  so far joe and love have killed a total  of 10 people as well as indirectly  causing 